### Description:
- CyanoHex transforms invasive algae and water hyacinths into a biodegradable honeycomb fertiliser net that reduces runoff, improves soil health and boosts crop yields. By repurposing pollutants and supporting fungal–plant symbiosis, it tackles eutrophication, restores waterways and creates green jobs, offering farmers a low-cost, sustainable alternative to synthetic fertilisers.
